 261  *==============================================================================
 262  *  Periods
 263  *==============================================================================
 264  * The set TIME is the period of time for which we have projections for GDP,
 265  * population and economically active population .
 266  TIME Time periods
 267  /
 268  2019*2050
 269  *2019
 270   
 271  /
 272  T(time)
 273  T1(time)         First period;
 274  T1(time)         = yes$[ord(time) eq 1];
