 294  *==============================================================================
 295  *  2.1 Parameters
 296  *==============================================================================
 297   A_K(z)               Scale parameter (investment function)
 298   aij(i,j,z)           Input output coefficient
 299   aij2(i,j,z)          Input output coefficient (intermediate energy)
 300   B_KD(j,z)            Scale parameter (CES - composite capital)
 301   B_LD(j,z)            Scale parameter (CES - composite labor)
 302   B_M1(i,z)            Scale parameter (CES - composite commodity)
 303   B_M2(i,z)            Scale parameter (CES - composite import)
 304   B_VA(j,z)            Scale parameter (CES - value added)
 305   B_KLE(j,z)           Scale parameter (CES - composite KLE)
 306   B_ENER(j,z)          Scale parameter (CES - composite ENER)
 307   B_X1(i,z)            Scale parameter (CET - total output)
 308   B_X2(i,z)            Scale parameter (CET - composite export)
 309   B_X3(i,z)            Scale parameter (CES - top level)
 310   B_X4(z)              Scale parameter (CES - Aggregated Electricity)
 311   beta_D_X1(i,z)       Share parameter (CET - total output - local sales)
 312   beta_EX_X1(i,z)      Share parameter (CET - total output - export)
 313   beta_X2(i,z,zj)      Share parameter (CET - composite export)
 314   beta_X3(j,i,z)       Share parameter (CES - top level)
 315   beta_X4(power, z)    Share parameter (CES - Aggregated Electricity)
 316   beta_KD(k,j,z)       Share parameter (CES - composite capital)
 317   beta_LD(l,j,z)       Share parameter (CES - composite labor)
 318   beta_M1(i,z)         Share parameter (CES - composite commodity)
 319   beta_M2(i,zj,z)      Share parameter (CES - composite import)
 320   beta_VA(j,z)         Share parameter (CES - value added)
 321   beta_KLE(j,z)        Share parameter (CES - KLE composite)
 322   beta_ENER(ene,j,z)   Share parameter (CES - ENER composite)
 323   delta(z)             Depreciation rate of capital in country z
 324   eta                  Price elasticity of indexed transfers and parameters
 325   frisch(z)            Frisch parameter (LES function)
 326   gamma_GVT(i,z)       Share of commodity i in total current public expenditures on goods and services
 327   gamma_INV(i,z)       Share of commodity i in total investment expenditures
 328   gamma_LES(i,z)       Marginal share of commodity i in household consumption budget
 329   io(j,z)              Coefficient (Leontief - intermediate consumption)
 330   io2(j,z)             Coefficient (Leontief - intermediate energy consumption)
