 382  *==============================================================================
 383  *  2.2 Variables - Benchmark
 384  *==============================================================================
 385  *  Benchmark values of variables are parameters. Their acronyms are the
 386  *  corresponding variable names,followed by the letter "O".
 387   
 388  *==============================================================================
 389  *   2.2.1 Volume variables
 390  *==============================================================================
 391   CABXO(z)        Current account balance of region z in terms of the international currency (pseudo-volume variable)
 392   CO(i,z)         Consumption of commodity i by households in region z
 393   CGO(i,z)        Public consumption of commodity i in region z
 394   CIO(j,z)        Total intermediate consumption of industry j in region z
 395   CEO(j,z)        Total energy intermediate consumption of industry j in region z
 396   CMINO(i,z)      Minimum consumption of commodity i by households in region z
 397   CTH_REALO(z)    Real household consumption in region z
 398   DDO(i,z)        Domestic demand for commodity i produced locally in region z
 399   DIO(i,j,z)      Intermediate consumption of commodity i by industry j in region z
 400   DEO(ene,j,z)    Intermediate energy consumption of commodity i by industry j in region z
 401   DITO(i,z)       Total intermediate demand of commodity i in region z
 402   DSO(j,i,z)      Supply of commodity i by sector j to the domestic market
 403   DSO_I(i,z)      Supply of commodity i to the domestic market of region z
 404   DSO_J(j,z)      Supply of activity j to the domestic market of region z
 405   EXO(i,z,zj)     Quantity of product i exported by country z to country zj
 406   EXTO(i,z)       Supply of composite commodity i by region z to the export market
 407   EXTTO(j,i,z)    Supply of activity j to the export market i of region z
 408   G_REALO(z)      Current real government expenditures on goods and services in region z
 409   GDP_BP_REALO(z) Real GDP at basic prices
 410   GDP_MP_REALO(z) Real GDP at market prices
 411   GDP_BP_W_REALO  Real GDP at basic prices
 412   IMO(i,zj,z)     Quantity of product i imported by country z from country zj
 413   IMTO(i,z)       Quantity demanded of composite imports of commodity i by region z
 414   INDO(k,j,z)     Volume of new type k capital investment to industry j in region z
 415   INVO(i,z)       Final demand of commodity i for investment purposes (GFCF) in region z
 416   IT_REALO(z)     Real gross fixed capital formation
 417   KDO(k,j,z)      Demand for type k capital by industry j in region z
 418   KDCO(j,z)       Demand for composite capital by industry j in region z
 419   KSO(k,z)        Supply of type k capital in region z
 420   KSTO(z)         Total supply of capital in region z
 421   LDO(l,j,z)      Demand for type l labor by industry j in region z
 422   LDCO(j,z)       Demand for composite labor by industry j in region z
 423   LSO(l,z)        Supply of type l labor in region z
 424   MRGNO(i,z)      Domestic production of commodity i in region z exported as international margin services
 425   POPO(z)         Population in 2019
 426   QO(i,z)         Quantity demanded of composite commodity i in region z
 427   VAO(j,z)        Value added of industry j in region z
 428   KLEO(j,z)       KLE of industry j in region z
 429   XSO_I(i,z)      Commoidty i total production
 430   XSO(j,i,z)      Total output of industry j in region z
 431   XSTO(j,z)       Total output of industry j
 432   POWERQO(z)      Total power output in region z
 433   
 434  *==============================================================================
 435  *   2.2.2 Price variables
 436  *==============================================================================
 437   eO(z)           Exchange rate (price of international currency in terms of region z local currency)
 438   IRO(z)          Interest rate
 439   PO(i,z)         Basic price of commodity i in region z
 440   PO2(j,i,z)      Basic price of industry js production of commodity i
 441   PO3(i,j,z)
 442   PO4(i,j,z)
 443   PPOWERO(z)
 444   PIO(i,z)
 445   PTO(j,z)        Basic price of industry js output
 446   PCO(i,z)        Purchaser price of composite commodity i (including all taxes and margins) in region z
 447   PCIO(j,z)       Intermediate consumption price index of industry j in region z
 448   PCEO(j,z)       Intermediate energy consumption price index of industry j in region z
 449   PDO(i,z)        Price of local product i sold on region z domestic market (including all taxes)
 450   PEO(i,z,zj)     Price received for commodity i exported to region zj by region z (excluding export taxes)
 451   PETO(i,z)       Border price of composite commodity i exported by region z
 452   PIXCONO(z)      Consumer price index in region z
 453   PIXGDPO(z)      GDP deflator in region z
 454   PIXGDP_WO       World GDP deflator
 455   PIXGVTO(z)      Public expenditures price index in region z
 456   PIXINVO(z)      Investment price index in region z
 457   PKO(z)          Price of new capital in region z
 458   PLO(i,z)        Price of local product i (excluding all taxes on products) in region z
 459   PMO(i,zj,z)     Price of commodity i imported by region z from region zj (including all taxes duties and margins)
 460   PMTO(i,z)       Price of composite commodity i imported by region z (including all taxes duties and margins)
 461   PPO(j,z)        Unit cost of industry j in region z including taxes directly related to the use of capital and labor but excluding other taxes on production
 462   PVAO(j,Z)       Price of industry j value added in region z (including taxes on production directly related to the use of capital and labor)
 463   PKLEO(j,z)      Price of industry j KLE in region z
 464   PWMO(i,zj,z)    World price of commodity i imported from country zj by region z (expressed in international currency)
 465   PWMGO(i)        World price of margin i (expressed in international currency)
 466   PWXO(i,z,zj)    World price of commodity i exported to country zj by region z (expressed in international currency)
 467   RO(k,j,z)       Rental rate of type k capital in industry j of region z
 468   RCO(j,z)        Rental rate of industry j composite capital in region z
 469   RKO(k,z)        Rental rate of type k capital in region z
 470   RTIO(k,j,z)     Rental rate paid by industry j for type k capital in region z including capital taxes
 471   UO(z)           User cost of capital in region z
 472   WO(l,z)         Wage rate of type l labor in region z
 473   WCO(j,z)        Wage rate of industry j composite labor in region z
 474   WTIO(l,j,z)     Wage rate paid z by industry j for type l labor in region including payroll taxes
